      "text": "Keep that desk and schedule a volunteer training hour before the Friday deliveries.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "reply-2",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "The training can run Thursday evening while the reference desk handles returns.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "user-2",
