      "text": "Update the signage plan for large-print readers without extending the closure.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "reply-4",
      "role": "assistant",
      "text": "Put temporary signs at each aisle entrance and keep the lift route clear.\n"
    },
    {
      "id": "user-4",
      "role": "user",
      "text": "Now finish the plan with the original north shelves and an extra return station.\n"
    }
